      "function": "write_req_chunk",
      "line": 587,
      "var": "stream->req._write_req_chunk.cb",
      "code": "if (is_end_stream) { stream->req._write_req_chunk_done = NULL; stream->req._write_req_chunk.cb = NULL; }",
      "note": "In streaming body mode (_write_req_chunk_done != NULL) the END_STREAM branch clears the done flag and the chunk callback, but never advances the stream state out of RECV_BODY and never sends an error (RST_STREAM/STREAM_CLOSED). The stream is left in a state where data received after end_of_stream is not rejected.",
      "role": "root_cause"
    },
