      "note": "A further DATA frame sent after end_of_stream arrives while stream->state is still H2O_HTTP2_STREAM_STATE_RECV_BODY, so the only guard that would send an error (H2O_HTTP2_ERROR_STREAM_CLOSED) is bypassed.",
      "role": "intermediate"
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
